OL,3,AVolkswagen board approves plan to cut
OL,4,Aanother 50,000 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe board of German car giant
OL,7,FVolkswagen has approved a plan to cut
OL,8,Fanother 50,000 jobs as part of the
OL,9,Fbiggest restructuring in the group's
OL,10,Falmost nine-decade history.
OL,12,FIt brings the total number of roles the
OL,13,Fcarmaker plans to shed by 2030 to
OL,14,F100,000, after announcing in March that
OL,15,Fit would cut 50,000 roles.
OL,17,FThe group - which includes Audi,
OL,18,FPorsche, Skoda as well as the VW brand
OL,19,F- is also considering the future of
OL,20,Ffour of its German plants.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
