OL,3,AVolkswagen board approves plan to cut
OL,4,Aanother 50,000 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move is a "strong signal" for the
OL,7,Ffuture of the firm, which is "taking
OL,8,Fresponsibility for our entire
OL,9,Fworkforce", VW's chief executive Oliver
OL,10,FBlume said in a statement on Thursday.
